# Everything under data/ is rebuilt from the sibling projects and stays out of
# git -- EXCEPT data/manual/, the human decision files, which are
# version-controlled and never machine-overwritten (CLAUDE.md rule 4,
# docs/ENTITY_RESOLUTION.md).
#
# Written as data/* rather than data/ because git will not re-include a path
# inside a wholly excluded directory: the negation is only reachable if the
# directory itself was never excluded.
data/*
!data/manual/
data/manual/*
!data/manual/*.csv

venv/

# Local-only tools (docs/PRIVACY.md): pipeline/review.html embeds the entire
# unreviewed review_queue.csv verbatim, including every individual x
# individual name-collision guess. index.html is served from the repo root by
# GitHub Pages, so a committed pipeline/ would publish the raw, unreviewed
# candidate list right alongside the finished site -- this must never be
# committed, only generated locally on demand by build/build_review_tool.py.
pipeline/
